"""Single source of truth for the local-service version.

Bump SERVICE_VERSION whenever a route is added/removed or a response model
changes shape. The desktop app compares this value (via /health) against the
version its HttpServiceBridge was built for; a mismatch means a stale service
process is still bound to the port and must be respawned — the root cause of
"Could not reach /analyze/…" panels (spec §0).
"""

SERVICE_VERSION = "0.2.105"  # 0.2.105: MAC-1 - POST /settings/credentials (the desktop hands the service its saved API keys, held in memory; on macOS the service no longer reads the Keychain through /usr/bin/security, which prompted); event streams open with a 1 KB SSE comment (macOS held the first 512 bytes back); harshness and resonance recalibrated on released music (FULL-3); decode budget 512 MiB. 0.2.104: SHIP-4 - UpdateCheckResponse.download_url (the release's installer for this OS), download_state and installer_path (downloaded in the background, SHA-256 verified, installed by the desktop on restart); the release feed is the public KhensuLabs/khensu-mixing repository, checked at launch (hourly throttle) and on demand. 0.2.103: MemoryResponse.memory_gate (GET /diagnostics/memory: the analysis jobs' memory budget, in use, waits, overcommits); /analyze/integrity answers 422 for undecodable audio and 413 over the decode budget. 0.2.102: NEW-9 - EmotionalArcData.track_mood (the CLAP mood probe's whole-track tags) and ArtifactScanResponse.clap_probe (the CLAP AI-generation probe, beside the fused verdict, learned scans only). 0.2.101: CON-7 - SourceTriageRequest.material ("auto" default; "mix" reads the full intake's cached triage of the session mix). 0.2.100: PERF-6 - GET /copilot/apply_chain/events/{job_id}: the render status as server-sent events (one per change, ending at a terminal state), replacing the 750 ms status polling. 0.2.99: FEAT-5 - reference library entries carry tags and genre (EmbeddingIndexEntry / EmbeddingMatch), POST /embeddings/index/meta sets them, and list / similar / search_text take tag and genre filters; WF-14 - ReportRequest.follow_up_scans (the session scan store, listed in the HTML and PDF report). 0.2.98: FEAT-4 - POST /copilot/stem_rebalance/suggest (gains toward the genre stem balance) and POST /copilot/stem_rebalance (re-summed stems as a new version, true peak held at -1 dBTP, residual to the original). 0.2.97: FEAT-10 - GET /components (optional components, installed or not, installable from the app), POST /components/install/start and GET /components/install/status/{job_id} (pip --require-hashes from the hashed export, behind the model_downloads toggle). 0.2.96: FEAT-3 - ReferenceChainRequest.amount (0..1, how far toward the reference); ReferenceChainResponse gains amount and predicted_curve (band_centers_hz, delta_before_db, delta_after_db). 0.2.95: NEW-1 song structure - SectionMarker and SectionAnalysisResult gain role (intro | verse | pre-chorus | chorus | bridge | outro | section) and group (repetition group A, B, ...), SectionMarker boundary_strength; section labels are "Verse 1", "Chorus 2"... from self-similarity instead of 8-bar blocks. 0.2.94: PERF-7 - GET /diagnostics/memory (result caches by name, the decoded-audio cache, pool sizes, resident memory); the DSP pool is sized from the CPU count; ENG-5/ENG-6 moved routes between modules (operation ids of the table routes changed, wire shapes did not). 0.2.93: CUT-9 - /platform_masters/start renders safety variants by default (each keeps the master's loudness and is only made safe for the platform's true-peak ceiling); PlatformMastersRequest.match_loudness brings each to the platform's loudness target as before. 0.2.92: GEN-1 genre accuracy - GET/POST/DELETE /genre/examples (the user's confirmed or chosen genres, blended into the probe); GenreCandidate and GenreBlendEntry gain group (subgenres the probe cannot tell apart); GenreContextResponse gains personal_examples; GenreClassifierAccuracy gains group_top1/group_top5/tracks. 0.2.91: NEW-9 genre probe - musical_context (GenreContextResponse) gains family, family_probability, families and classifier_accuracy when a CLAP probe trained on the genre corpus produced the candidates (classifier_status clap_probe_cross_validated); the deep genre_blend and genre_detected/subgenre_detected come from the same probe when CLAP can run. 0.2.90: AnalyzeRequest.purpose ("full" | "fix_check") - an advanced /analyze/start fix check skips the emotional arc, translation prediction, stereo-field timeline and benchmark (no finding reads them) and is cached apart from the full result. 0.2.89: REF-9 - five duplicate routes removed: /analyze/genre_context (full intake returns the same musical_context), /analyze/midi_extract (sound_recreation covers it), /command/voice/upload (/command/voice takes a path), /copilot/scanned_plugins (the app owns the list), /copilot/apply_graph (apply_chain takes a graph). 0.2.88: cutting-edge roadmap 2026-11-07 (CE-*) - 62 new routes: embeddings index/similar/search_text, taste model, fit_chain, partial loudness, explain/moment, agent/mix jobs, command parse/execute/voice, automation export, immersive check, provenance sign/read (C2PA), stream_preview, delivery package jobs, diagnostics/accel, analysis cache, counterfactuals, collab comments/bundles/versions, listening room, reference profiles. 0.2.87: reframe 2026-11-07 - /humanize/targeted (closed-loop, detector-confidence target) replaced by /humanize/analog_feel (single-pass creative render: amount + tape_drift/fader_ride/room_tone, no scan, no confidence fields); /humanize/strip_metadata replaced by /metadata/clean (removes workflow/personal tags only; identity, rights and AI-provenance/disclosure tags kept, reported as kept_tags/kept_provenance_tags). 0.2.86: audit 2026-11-06 fix program - every route is a typed ResponseModel with exclude_unset (meta-tested) and every request a RequestModel (unknown keys 422 under tests); AI-artifact scan splits provenance vs production-style evidence (evidence_class/effective_weight/provenance_found/score_label/detector_errors, include_learned request flag); batch render + platform masters go through validate->quarantine->guardrail (render_state/quarantine_path, blocked/rejected statuses); copilot cancels return {ok,status}; transport is multi-instance (instance_id, seek since=/generation, params target_instance_id); /health route manifest auth-only; loudness curve / phase grid nulls for silence; streaming normalization measurable/note + canonical platform ids (apple_music, amazon_music, deezer); chords function; quarter_note_bpm; tuning caveat; comping/gain_rider/align_takes output paths; ITU-exact K-weighting (+~0.04 LU). 0.2.85: guardrail (RenderGuardrail/GuardrailMetrics/PreRenderValidation), mastering-agent iterations (MasteringIteration/deltas/metrics) and full-intake stage results (FullIntakeResults/IntakeStemContext) are typed - same wire shape, except nested unset guardrail keys now serialize as null on the synchronous apply_chain/apply_graph routes; source_triage/pan_balance/arrangement/depth/masking models keep undeclared keys (PanBandSummary gains side_share, which was being dropped). 0.2.84: Demucs works again (htdemucs SHA-256 pinned from the publisher URL; restricted unpickler that accepts HTDemucs + numpy scalars - torch 2.2 weights_only could not, so separation always fell back to HPSS); WavMark decodes 3 short excerpts instead of the whole track (deep scan of a 2:19 song 57 s, was ~17 min). No route or schema change - bumped so a stale service process is replaced. 0.2.83: every route has a typed response_model (ResponseModel, exclude_unset - same wire shape) and the C++ client is generated from it; JobStatus enum; new routes: multitrack scan/start/status/cancel, album consistency + master plan/start/status/cancel (DDP/cue/WAV), delivery_compliance (EBU R128, ATSC A/85, podcast), updates/check; export-targets gains category/tolerance/measurement fields. 0.2.82: decision_hash validated (hex, <=64) on apply_chain/apply_graph/batch and added to apply_section_chain + override_guardrail requests; recorded in their events and job results. 0.2.81: verification sweep 2026-10-16 - undecodable / non-finite-float audio is 422 (was 500 or passed through); /health never takes the bearer token; ApplyChainResponse + apply_chain job result carry stage_levels; sound_recreation midi_summary extraction_backend/low_quality_extraction; pitch_accuracy tuning keys on no-notes returns; genre_context works below 12.8 kHz. 0.2.80: audit 2026-10-15 - /health?nonce= adds HMAC proof; docs/openapi off by default; auth + byte-counted body limit before routing; network paths 403; report writer extension allowlists; reference_hz on midi_extract/sound_recreation/midi_variation; vocal_harmony key/bpm detected (key_source/bpm_source); midi_variation bpm_source/time_signature; ReportRequest bpm/key confidence; artifacts detectors_not_run/calibrated; humanize compared_detectors/scan_inputs; platform masters could_not_reach/target_reached/loudness_miss_lu; dither source_bits/dither_needed; Limiter = true-peak ceiling; Low/HighShelfFilter effects; chat history trimmed not rejected
